; B3: a misspelled variant in a `when` arm over a RESOLVABLE union
; (`when w: Nome` for `None`) used to leave variant_tag at 0 — colliding with
; the real first variant — so emit_choose's tag dedup dropped an arm and
; misdispatched with no error. A resolved union whose variant tag lookup fails
; (and is not a throws-call synthetic Error/Success) now diagnoses.
; Self-hosted-only.
; xfail: unknown variant: Nome

package scaly 0.1.0

function check() returns int
{
    let x Option[int].Some(7)
    choose x
        when v: Some
            return v
        when w: Nome
            return 0
        else
            return 0
}

function main() returns int
{
    return check()
}
